{
  "_id": "3CdlyGDWt1ilt7g6",
  "name": "Elder White Fox",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/WhiteFox_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You have grown nine ethereal fox tails to empower yourself.</p><ul><li><p>Your <strong>Body</strong> and <strong>Soul</strong> increase by <strong>+2</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Your <strong>Stride </strong>speed increases by <strong>+5</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Other creatures have <strong>Disadvantage</strong> on checks to resist the effects of your spells or <strong>Path</strong> abilities.</p></li><li><p>Once per turn, when you would be hit by an attack or targeted by a hostile spell or ability, you may substitute yourself with an illusory clone that disappears shortly after the triggering action, while you reappear at a location of your choice within <strong>30 spaces</strong>. As you reappear, you may immediately make a <strong>Stealth </strong>check to hide.</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Open Sans',sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-dcd12564-7fff-bcb5-c45b-7173bd86e5d6\">This effect lasts until the end of combat, you become </strong><strong>Incapacitated</strong>, or you are <strong>Dying</strong>. After you use this ability, you cannot use any ability with the <strong>Apex</strong> trait until you complete a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</span></p>",
